", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὁρόων ἐπ' ἀπείρονα πόντον looking over the sea,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.350", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὁρᾶν πρός τι look towards,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀκρωτήριον τὸ πρὸς Μέγαρα ὁρῶν Th. 2.93", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "AP 7.496", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "("}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Simon.", "author_abbreviation": "Simon.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cj.) ; πρὸς πλοῦν ὁρᾷ looks to sail (i.e. is ready),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. IA [1624]", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "018", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὁ. ἐπὶ τὴν προδοσίαν D.S. 36.3", "author_abbreviation": "D.S.", "tlg_author": "0060", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πρὸς σπονδάς Id. 33.1", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0060", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". have sight, opp. μὴ ὁρᾶν, to be blind,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Aj. 84", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὅσ' ἂν λέγωμεν, πάνθ' ὁρῶντα λέξομεν [though I am blind,] my words shall have eyes, i.e. shall be to the purpose,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. OC 74", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐν σκότῳ . . οὓς μὲν οὐκ ἔδει ὀψοίαθ', i.e. should be blind,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. OT 1274", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀμβλύτερον ὁ., opp. ὀξύτερον βλέπειν,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. R. 596a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐπὶ σμικρὸν ὁ. to be short-sighted,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. Tht. 174e", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὁ. βραχύ τι Id. R. 488b", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". see to, look to, i.e. take or give heed,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 10.239", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὁ. εἰς γλῶσσαν . . ἀνδρός look to, pay heed to,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Sol. 11.7", "author_abbreviation": "Sol.", "tlg_author": "0263", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Supp. 104", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(lyr.): freq. in imper., like βλέπε , folld. by a dependent clause,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὅρα ὅπως . . Ar. Ec. 300", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 5.27", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὅρα εἰ . . see whether . . ,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pr. 997", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Phd. 118", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", 