94", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. ; ὀφθαλμοῖσιν or ἐν ὀφθαλμοῖσιν ὁρᾶν to see with or before the eyes,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 24.392", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 8.459", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. ; αἰεὶ τέρμ' ὁρόων always keeping it in sight, keeping his eye on it,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 23.323", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; φίλως χ' ὁρόῳτε καὶ εἰ δέκα πύργοι Ἀχαιῶν . . μαχοίατο, i.e. δέκα πύργους, εἰ μαχοίατο,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "4.347", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὁ. τινά look to (for aid),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 45.64", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "045", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": in signfs."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "combined, οὐχ ὁρᾷς ὁρῶν τάδε;"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Ag. 1623", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 25.89", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "025", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". ζώει καὶ ὁρᾷ φάος ἠελίοιο, poet. for ζῆν, like βλέπειν ,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 18.61", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "001